### 🛠️ SOVEREIGN CHECKPOINT SYSTEM COMMANDS
- `!baseline [label] | list` - Create a snapshot checkpoint of the current code state and environment files across all suite repositories (or list all available checkpoints with `list`).
- `!alamo [tag]` - Hard reset all suite repositories back to the specified baseline tag and restore the backed up environment configuration files.
- `!finalize` - Soft reset and squash all baseline commits back into the staging area across all suite repositories to clean up git history.

